# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Checkpoints of a Python simulation (D[python-checkpoints]) on the CPU in
# double precision, scenario python-to-cli of Inputs/python_checkpoints.py.
# A Python simulation writes its checkpoint at step 10 and `mdir run
# --continue` takes it to step 20: equal to a Python continuation of the
# same file to the bit, and to the run of `mdir run` that did not stop
# within the tolerances of python_checkpoints.py.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_checkpoints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU Double mdir %t python-to-cli | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NVE CPU Double
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NVT CPU Double
# CHECK: Python -> mdir run NPT CPU Double
# CHECK: checkpoints python-to-cli CPU Double passed
